lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8502, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013gFWz57fPS9VAHyDTD29DJ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10173, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019oyDaKirQzCoxMoZEFqWrB", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10473, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019oyDaKirQzCoxMoZEFqWrB", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10473, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019oyDaKirQzCoxMoZEFqWrB", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13644, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QLK98eLjbpX8bE8DkJSaPP", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17644, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QLK98eLjbpX8bE8DkJSaPP", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17644, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QLK98eLjbpX8bE8DkJSaPP", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19498, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01S7G71yCG1iTQ7PFnL2iUa6", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19798, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01S7G71yCG1iTQ7PFnL2iUa6", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19798, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01S7G71yCG1iTQ7PFnL2iUa6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19798, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BwSVzHmgw7gd8bvPkPxTBm", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20098, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BwSVzHmgw7gd8bvPkPxTBm", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20098, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BwSVzHmgw7gd8bvPkPxTBm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25157, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Gxzzem2qQwyJEe5BYdAnwH", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. The SRE agent rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on mixed versions. A second attempt finished in all regions. checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, is healthy, and has a 0.2% error rate. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error during rollback, and check why v2.3.1 reached production after its RC was unhealthy in staging.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55757, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Gxzzem2qQwyJEe5BYdAnwH", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55757, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Gxzzem2qQwyJEe5BYdAnwH", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57434, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011NpQT98zjiSbzjsSxixfau", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57734, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011NpQT98zjiSbzjsSxixfau", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57734, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011NpQT98zjiSbzjsSxixfau", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62850, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy. Its error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The bad release was v2.3.1, which was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Its release candidate had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions. Since it was the same rollback to the same version, I ran it once more. That worked, and I confirmed the service is healthy on v2.3.0 everywhere.\n- No approval was needed: v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to open the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't send it again. There's only one incident and one page to on-call.\n- INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and second attempt) and three follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - look into the orchestrator error during the rollback\n  - check why v2.3.1 was released to production after it failed in staging", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012pzJrvPxscDbBnDZeqxnen", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Vv344cZ4DMhYv2miWPaXxA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_013gFWz57fPS9VAHyDTD29DJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019oyDaKirQzCoxMoZEFqWrB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout stopped partway: only us-east is on v2.3.0. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01QLK98eLjbpX8bE8DkJSaPP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01S7G71yCG1iTQ7PFnL2iUa6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BwSVzHmgw7gd8bvPkPxTBm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Gxzzem2qQwyJEe5BYdAnwH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest production deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. The SRE agent rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left the regions on mixed versions. A second attempt finished in all regions. checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, is healthy, and has a 0.2% error rate. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error during rollback, and check why v2.3.1 reached production after its RC was unhealthy in staging.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011NpQT98zjiSbzjsSxixfau", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy. Its error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The bad release was v2.3.1, which was live in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Its release candidate had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- I rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on different versions. Since it was the same rollback to the same version, I ran it once more. That worked, and I confirmed the service is healthy on v2.3.0 everywhere.\n- No approval was needed: v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to open the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't send it again. There's only one incident and one page to on-call.\n- INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and second attempt) and three follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - look into the orchestrator error during the rollback\n  - check why v2.3.1 was released to production after it failed in staging", "type": "text"}]}]}